(7422546, 1171359, 97225, '<td valign="top">What a fabulous piece of sculpture. You composed your shot well and the deep blue really adds to it even if the late hour gave some problems.<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by snaffles:</b></div><hr/><i> Excellent work!  How on earth did you not capture yourself in the reflections?  Oh and congrats on the HM :-) </i></td></tr></table></td>', 'What a fabulous piece of sculpture. You composed your shot well and the deep blue really adds to it even if the late hour gave some problems. Originally posted by snaffles: Excellent work!  How on earth did you not capture yourself in the reflections?  Oh and congrats on the HM :-) ', '2015-12-16 02:58:14.000000', NULL, 0),
